<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="band reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Neon Customizer</span>
      <h2>Your words, your colour, your size.</h2>
      <p>Type anything, pick from eight tube colours and three sizes, and watch the price update as you go. No guessing, no email back-and-forth.</p>
      <div class="band__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/#customizer">Open the customizer</a>
        <a class="btn btn--wa" data-wa="Hi Neon Adda, I have a design idea I'd like to discuss." href="#">
